{"skill":{"slug":"google-analytics","displayName":"google-analytics"},"version":{"version":"1.2.8","createdAt":1790937423674,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":61178,"sha256":"bba5e125b5073d180a715470bc2b3472c294df4a4f8a5f98100a4856d5535394","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2220,"sha256":"4cd25e56cc008745c6734ae9b0e2207e8168fbc745b3da47d3df414413de2e5c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790937957309,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7b97254f3656c65a91d8fb7736bf92f8754fdb77d73aee19218160fb1b77f577","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7b97254f3656c65a91d8fb7736bf92f8754fdb77d73aee19218160fb1b77f577","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790937707889},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790937957309},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed Google Analytics integration with OAuth, admin writes, and optional automation that requires explicit user approval for sensitive actions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, a Maton account, OAuth, and Google Analytics access are proportionate for this API integration; raw HTTP with a Maton API key is documented only as a fallback when the CLI cannot be used.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI/SDK package versions via npm, Homebrew, pip, or npm SDKs; this requires normal package/network trust but is disclosed and purpose-aligned.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill repeatedly scopes writes, connection creation, hosted functions, trigger destinations, and local event execution to user-requested actions with explicit confirmation and specific resource identifiers.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth credentials persist in the OS credential store, and functions/triggers/destinations can create persistent hosted automation or forwarding, but the artifact clearly discloses these effects and requires user approval.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose matches the documented capabilities: Google Analytics Admin/Data API access through Maton, with read-only reporting preferred and Admin API writes reserved for explicit administrative tasks.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, users should understand that Admin API operations affect live Google Analytics accounts and hosted functions or triggers can run persistently. Prefer the Data API for reports, confirm exact account/property IDs before writes, avoid broad trigger destinations, and do not expose Maton or provider credentials.","findings":"[SkillSpector] expected: SkillSpector reported no issues; artifact review found no hidden instruction override, exfiltration, destructive automation, or undisclosed persistence.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no results; the reviewed files are Markdown-only with no executable packaged scripts.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790937957309}}}}}